.TH @INFOCMP@ 1M 2026-02-07 "ncurses @NCURSES_MAJOR@.@NCURSES_MINOR@" "User commands"
.ie \n(.g \{\
.ds `` \(lq
.ds '' \(rq
.ds '  \(aq
.\}
.el \{\
.ie t .ds `` ``
.el   .ds `` ""
.ie t .ds '' ''
.el   .ds '' ""
.ie t .ds '  \(aq
.el   .ds '  '
.\}
.
.de bP
.ie n  .IP \(bu 4
.el    .IP \(bu 2
..
.
